                li 
                    p The Terms are governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of Qatar Free Zones Authority and any regulations, rules, policies, resolutions, decisions or orders issued from time to time in connection with Qatar Free Zones Authority.

            ol 
                b.fs-20 Privacy Policy 
                li.mt-3 
                    p Your privacy and confidentiality of your information are important to us. Hence, QFZ respect your rights concerning the processing, storing, transmit, transfer or process your personal information. If you do elect to provide personal or company information (such as name, address, e-mail, telephone etc), QFZ will not disclose it to any third parties unless we have your written consent or are required to do so by law.
                li 
                    p We may change the Privacy Policy from time to time by posting the revised text on this page with a new “Last Updated” date. All changes will become effective when posted unless indicated otherwise. We encourage you to regularly check this page to review any changes we might make.
            ol 
                b.fs-20 Cookies Policy
                li.mt-3 
                    p By using this Website, you agree to QFZ’s use of cookies on your device in accordance with the terms of this policy.
                li 
                    p A cookie is a small text-only file of information that is sent or transferred to your device (such as your computer, smartphone or other web-enabled device) when you access a website. Cookies allow the website to recognise your device when you revisit and remember certain information about your prior visit such as which pages you visited, choices you made from menus, any specific information you entered into forms and the time and date of your visit. Among other things, cookies help us evaluate what parts of our websites are useful and which need improvement.
                li 
                    p If you do not wish to accept cookies from this Website, please either disable cookies or refrain from using this Website.
                li 
                    p Some of our cookies may collect and store your personal data, such as your name, email address or IP address. We are committed to respecting and protecting your privacy and will ensure that personal data we collect is kept and treated in strict confident. For further details of how we manage your personal data, please refer to our Privacy Policy.
                li 
                    p For further information, visit 
                        a.text-blue(href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener") allaboutcookies.org
            ol 
                b.fs-20 Fraud Warning
                li.mt-3 
                    p QFZ name, logo and Website’s contents have been used in fraudulent emails and websites targeting prospective investors. These emails and websites may refer investors and/or inviting investors to provide any information attempting to engage in financial fraud. The methods being used are increasingly sophisticated and communications may appear to be authentic.
                li 
                    p Please be aware that all communication by email from QFZ is from an email address ending only with&nbsp;
                        a.text-blue(href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener") x@qfz.gov.qa.
                        | Any email received other than [@qfz.gov.qa] is not an authentic communication and we advise you to contact&nbsp;
                        a.text-blue(href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener") info@qfz.gov.qa
                        |&nbsp;[insert website or contact number] to verify its authenticity before proceeding.
                li 
                    p Information about QFZ and/or its tenders and procedure for vendor registration is available on the QFZ website here: 
                        a.text-blue(href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener") Tenders – Qatar Free Zones Authority (qfz.gov.qa)]              
                li 
                    p QFZ will not accept liability, under any circumstances, for loss and/or damage resulting from these unauthorized emails, whether direct or consequential.
                li 
                    p Any misuse or misleading misrepresentations of the QFZ or logo should be reported immediately to 
                        a.text-blue(href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener") it-shield@qfz.gov.qa
                li 
                    p Please also be mindful to always follow proper due diligence procedures when engaging in any activities and please carry out your own independent verification of facts and data.
            ol 
                b.fs-20 Content
                li.mt-3  
                    p The information on this Website is for information purposes only. It is believed to be reliable, but we do not warrant its completeness, timeliness or accuracy. User accesses, uses, and relies upon such content is at user’s own risk. Please seek the advice of professionals as necessary regarding the evaluation of any content on this Website.
                li 
                    p You agree that (i) you will not engage in any activities related to this Website that are contrary to applicable law, regulation or the terms of any agreements you have with us, and (ii) in circumstances where locations of this Website require identification for access, you will establish commercially reasonable security procedures and controls to limit access to your password or other identifying information to authorized individuals. You agree that you will not use any robot, spider, other automatic device or manual process to monitor or copy our web pages, data or the content contained herein or for any other unauthorized purpose without our prior expressed written permission.
                li 
                    p We may discontinue or make changes in the information, products or services described herein at any time without prior notice to you and without any liability to you. Any dated information is published as of its date only or, if no date is stated, the date of first posting. We do not undertake any obligation or responsibility to update or amend any information on this Website. We reserve the right to terminate any or all Website offerings or transmissions without prior notice to you.
                li 
                    p The electronic versions of legislation and other official materials on this Website, and any copies printed from them, are provided for convenience and information only. They are not the authoritative or definitive texts and should not be relied on as such. Official copies of legislation can be viewed at the offices of the QFZ or obtained on request to them.
                li 
                    p This Website may contain material sent to the QFZ by third parties. You should note that the third parties are responsible for ensuring that the material they submit to the QFZ complies with applicable laws and the QFZ is not responsible for any error, omission or inaccuracy in the material. The QFZ reserves the right to omit, suspend or change any third-party material submitted as it considers appropriate. 
                li 
                    p At various points on this Website you may be offered links to other sites, the material and content shown on these offered links are solely owned and controlled by the owners of such sites. The QFZ does not control or verify any material produced on these sites and is not responsible for the content of any link in a linked site, or any changes or updates to such sites. These sites will have their own terms and policies and you are advised to read them carefully.
            ol 
